  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CR: FTF Building a Resilient Future</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(USAID Bureau for Resilience and Food Security (RFS)):  Purpose: The purpose of the FTF Building a Resilient Future Project (also referred to as the Global Resilience Partnership (GRP)) is to advance the adoption and implementation of USAID resilience key principles and realize the Agency&apos;s desired results through more effective resilience programming. ..Activities: GRP is guided by the USAID Resilience Policy with a focus on three areas: (1) Building a more robust and globally recognized resilience community of practice; (2) Policy convening and influence to advance USAID resilience objectives; and (3) Increasing access to and application of resilience-oriented knowledge, solutions, expertise, and best practices through an online platform..Benefitting Countries: The Resilience Focus Countries as well as other Countries with USAID Missions integrating resilience approaches to their development and humanitarian portfolio</narrative>
  </description>
